---
layout: layouts/rearrange.njk
title: 把世界重新编排
description: 由回忆录书稿重新编排的三重叙事。沿未知、放手与成为三条星路，寻找同一段经历的不同回声。
permalink: /stories/rearrange/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="universe-hero" aria-labelledby="universe-title">
  <div class="cosmos-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="universe-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell universe-hero-inner">
    <p class="universe-kicker">AN INTERACTIVE MEMOIR · 2017—2026</p>
    <h1 id="universe-title">把世界<br><em>重新编排</em></h1>
    <p class="universe-intro">十年并非一条向上的曲线。同一份旧硬盘，可以通向技术、失去与家人；同一次失败，也可能是另一种生活的起点。</p>
    <div class="universe-invite"><span class="invite-line"></span><p>选择一颗星进入。三条路彼此交错，没有必须完成的顺序。</p><a href="#constellations">探索星图 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    <div class="universe-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">ARCHIVE / MEMORY / POSSIBILITY</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="constellation-section" id="constellations" aria-labelledby="constellation-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading constellation-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THREE WAYS THROUGH ONE LIFE</p><h2 id="constellation-title">从哪里开始？</h2><p>这三部分是反复出现的行动，不是人生的三个阶段。沿一条线读下去，或在故事中的交叉处换一条路。</p><p class="constellation-progress" data-story-progress>星图正在等待第一个足迹。</p></div>
    <div class="constellation-grid">
      {% for movement in rearrangeEdition.movements %}
      <article class="constellation-card" data-movement="{{ movement.id }}" style="--movement-color: {{ movement.color }}">
        <div class="constellation-card-top"><span>{{ movement.number }} / Ⅲ</span><span class="movement-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{{ movement.symbol }}</span></div>
        <p class="constellation-english">{{ movement.english }}</p><h3>{{ movement.title }}</h3><p class="constellation-quote">{{ movement.quote }}</p><p class="constellation-description">{{ movement.description }}</p>
        <div class="mini-constellation" aria-label="{{ movement.title }}的五个场景"><span class="constellation-thread" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {% for scene in rearrangeEdition.scenes %}{% if scene.movement == movement.id %}
          <a class="star-stop" href="{{ ('/stories/rearrange/' ~ scene.slug ~ '/') | relativeUrl(page.url) }}" data-map-node="{{ scene.slug }}" aria-label="{{ scene.title }}：{{ scene.question }}"><span class="star-point" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="star-label"><b>{{ scene.number }}</b>{{ scene.title }}</span></a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <a class="movement-enter" href="{{ ('/stories/rearrange/' ~ movement.start ~ '/') | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">从这条路进入 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="map-colophon"><p>取材于《把世界重新编排》136 页书稿。每一站由原书片段重新交织，场景末尾保留来源页码。</p><button type="button" data-story-reset>清空本机足迹</button></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="reading-note shell"><span class="reading-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div><p class="eyebrow">A NOTE ON THE THREE WAYS</p><h2>故事不会替过去补出确定的答案。</h2><p>三条星路受 T. S. Eliot《四个四重奏》中《东库克》的三句诗启发：经过未知、松开占有、走向尚未成为的自己。你读到的选择改变阅读视角，不会改写已经发生的人生。</p></div></section>
